983 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system is designed around a central communication model where all real-time interaction passes through a single relay server. This approach avoids direct coupling between clients and ensures that all clients remain synchronised. The game client and PWA both connect to this relay using WebSockets, while the REST API operates independently to handle authentication and session creation. This separation of components improves maintainability and scalability, which is a key principle in modern game system design.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 946 0 R
/Next 994 0 R
>>
endobj
